[agent:result]     In addition to setting function arguments directly, `hopsworks.login()` also reads the environment variables:
[agent:result]     `HOPSWORKS_HOST`, `HOPSWORKS_PORT`, `HOPSWORKS_PROJECT`, `HOPSWORKS_API_KEY`, `HOPSWORKS_HOSTNAME_VERIFICATION`, `HOPSWORKS_TRUST_STORE_PATH`, `HOPSWORKS_CERT_FOLDER` and `HOPSWORKS_ENGINE`.
